[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12542.55, "timestamp": "03:29:02", "text": "然后得到类似……呃，类似"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12545.59, "timestamp": "03:29:05", "text": "它的第一部分。 所以如果我的标题"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12547.51, "timestamp": "03:29:07", "text": "是“联合办公”，它就会出现在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12549.99, "timestamp": "03:29:09", "text": "联合办公播放列表中。 如果上面写着“"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12551.91, "timestamp": "03:29:11", "text": "与我合作”，那就是协同办公。 如果它一直陪伴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12553.67, "timestamp": "03:29:13", "text": "着我，那就会一直陪伴着我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12556.95, "timestamp": "03:29:16", "text": "就像那样。 我把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12560.15, "timestamp": "03:29:20", "text": "我的大部分游戏都添加了进去。 所以，就是原神。 所以，如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12562.389, "timestamp": "03:29:22", "text": "我的 Twitch 标题是《原神》，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12565.67, "timestamp": "03:29:25", "text": "那么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12568.15, "timestamp": "03:29:28", "text": "它就会检查我的 YouTube 播放列表，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12572.15, "timestamp": "03:29:32", "text": "其中也有《原神》，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12577.349, "timestamp": "03:29:37", "text": "对吗？ 所以，在获取了 YouTube 的内容，呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12579.59, "timestamp": "03:29:39", "text": "在从 Twitch 获取了信息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12581.83, "timestamp": "03:29:41", "text": "并将其链接到 YouTube"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12584.55, "timestamp": "03:29:44", "text": "播放列表等等之后，就到了这一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12587.429, "timestamp": "03:29:47", "text": "部分。 我们已经拿到播放列表链接了，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12589.269, "timestamp": "03:29:49", "text": "对吧？ 例如，我们拿到了播放列表链接"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12592.15, "timestamp": "03:29:52", "text": "。 呃，我现在是和别人一起办公，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12596.63, "timestamp": "03:29:56", "text": "对吧？ 这是播放列表链接"}]